# Test: Pipeline input validation with expects: annotation
# First document produces a dict
[port: 8080  hostname: "example.com"]

--- expects: @Dict
# Second document expects a dict with specific fields (nominal check only at runtime)

[merged: [port: %.port  host: %.hostname]]

=== out
Dict({"merged": Dict({"port": Int(8080), "host": String("example.com")})})
